Who openly preached against immorality

00:22:13.948 --> 00:22:15.823
And then found himself
wanted for killings

00:22:15.984 --> 00:22:17.908
He claimed were the work
of an invisible force,

00:22:18.493 --> 00:22:19.910
Killings carried
out --Get this --

00:22:20.406 --> 00:22:21.578
With a sharp instrument.

00:22:21.768 --> 00:22:22.872
What's the connection to lori?

00:22:23.484 --> 00:22:26.708
A man of religion who openly
preaches against immorality.

00:22:28.144 --> 00:22:30.772
Except this time instead
of saving the whole town,

00:22:30.772 --> 00:22:32.441
He's trying to save his only daughter.

00:22:32.441 --> 00:22:33.680
Reverend sorenson.

00:22:34.339 --> 00:22:35.650
Do you think he's summoning the spirit?

00:22:36.139 --> 00:22:36.831
Maybe.

00:22:38.834 --> 00:22:40.717
Or you know how a poltergeist

00:22:40.717 --> 00:22:42.457
Can haunt a person instead of a place?

00:22:42.873 --> 00:22:45.270
The spirit latches onto the
reverend's repressed emotions,

00:22:45.270 --> 00:22:46.104
Feeds off them.

00:22:47.945 --> 00:22:49.681
Without the reverend
ever even knowing it.

00:22:51.995 --> 00:22:54.388
Either way,  you should
keep an eye on lori tonight.

00:22:55.004 --> 00:22:55.936
What about you?

00:23:01.878 --> 00:23:03.816
I'm gonna go see if I can
find that unmarked grave.

00:24:03.813 --> 00:24:05.717
Here we go.

00:24:43.048 --> 00:24:44.259
That's it.

00:24:44.847 --> 00:24:48.543
Next time,  I get to watch
the cute girl's house.

00:25:02.726 --> 00:25:04.043
Hello,  preacher.

00:25:21.611 --> 00:25:24.222
I saw you from upstairs.

00:25:25.608 --> 00:25:27.094
What are you doing here?

00:25:28.960 --> 00:25:30.868
I'm keeping an eye on the place.

00:25:33.633 --> 00:25:34.994
I was worried.

00:25:34.994 --> 00:25:36.207
About me?

00:25:36.379 --> 00:25:38.076
Yeah,  sorry.

00:25:39.722 --> 00:25:41.005
No,  it's cool.

00:25:42.606 --> 00:25:43.814
I already called the cops.

00:25:46.503 --> 00:25:48.868
No,  seriously, I think you're sweet,

00:25:49.717 --> 00:25:52.413
Which is probably why you
should run away from me

00:25:52.413 --> 00:25:53.679
As fast as you can.

00:25:55.749 --> 00:25:57.168
Why would you say that?

00:25:58.239 --> 00:25:59.992
It's like I'm cursed or something.

00:26:00.733 --> 00:26:02.518
People around me keep dying.

00:26:06.674 --> 00:26:08.166
I thinkI know how you feel.

00:26:35.311 --> 00:26:36.709
Goodbye,  preacher.

00:26:49.656 --> 00:26:51.234
No one will talk to me anymore...

00:26:52.156 --> 00:26:53.240
Except you.

00:26:53.729 --> 00:26:55.532
The sheriff thinks I'm a suspect.

00:26:56.653 --> 00:26:58.021
And you know what my dad will say?

00:26:58.090 --> 00:26:59.918
"Pave faith."

00:27:00.230 --> 00:27:02.086
What does he know about faith?

00:27:04.904 --> 00:27:06.683
I heard you guys fighting before.

00:27:08.432 --> 00:27:11.873
He's seeing a woman, a married woman.

00:27:12.056 --> 00:27:13.350
I just found out.

00:27:14.671 --> 00:27:16.841
She comes to our
church with her husband,

00:27:17.186 --> 00:27:18.782
I know her kids,

00:27:19.309 --> 00:27:22.765
And he talks to me about
religion, about morality?

00:27:24.506 --> 00:27:26.125
It's like on one hand, you know,

00:27:26.867 --> 00:27:28.414
Just do what you want and be happy,

00:27:29.248 --> 00:27:31.402
But he
taught me --

00:27:31.521 --> 00:27:34.608
Raised me to believe that
if you do something wrong,

00:27:34.689 --> 00:27:35.821
You will get punished.

00:27:39.897 --> 00:27:42.101
I just don't know what to think anymore.

00:28:11.290 --> 00:28:12.300
Sam?

00:28:12.858 --> 00:28:14.557
Lori,  I can'T.

00:28:16.393 --> 00:28:18.243
That someone you lost?

00:28:22.237 --> 00:28:23.786
I'm sorry.

00:28:23.917 --> 00:28:24.635
Lori.

00:28:27.101 --> 00:28:28.941
Come inside,  please.

00:28:29.983 --> 00:28:31.724
I'll come in when I'm ready.

00:28:34.219 --> 00:28:36.099
Ack! Aah!

00:28:43.865 --> 00:28:45.458
No! No!

00:29:01.117 --> 00:29:01.948
Dad!

00:29:08.172 --> 00:29:09.721
It's okay.It's all right.

00:29:09.721 --> 00:29:11.181
It's okay. It's okay.

00:29:14.728 --> 00:29:15.725
We were just talking.

00:29:16.330 --> 00:29:20.084
Then lori's dad came
out, and then he appeared.

00:29:20.467 --> 00:29:24.036
A big man carrying a
weapon,  some kind of a hook?

00:29:24.242 --> 00:29:25.272
Yes,  sir.

00:29:26.012 --> 00:29:27.191
Ever seen him before?

00:29:29.076 --> 00:29:29.919
No,  sir.

00:29:31.671 --> 00:29:34.013
Son,  it seems every time I
turn around,  I'm seeing you.

00:29:35.938 --> 00:29:37.630
I suggest you try to
stay out of trouble.

00:29:39.278 --> 00:29:40.075
Yes,  sir.

00:29:41.051 --> 00:29:42.220
It's all right.I'm with him.

00:29:42.236 --> 00:29:44.892
That's my brother.Hey,  brother.

00:29:49.090 --> 00:29:50.132
Let him through.

00:29:50.465 --> 00:29:51.627
Thanks.

00:29:54.071 --> 00:29:55.053
Go ahead.

00:29:59.686 --> 00:30:00.165
You okay?

00:30:00.165 --> 00:30:00.711
Yeah.

00:30:01.239 --> 00:30:02.251
What the hell happened?

00:30:02.712 --> 00:30:03.515
Hookman.

00:30:03.869 --> 00:30:04.641
You saw him?

00:30:04.678 --> 00:30:05.452
Damn right.

00:30:05.627 --> 00:30:06.570
Why didn't you torch the bones?

00:30:06.570 --> 00:30:10.220
I did. Are you sure it's
the spirit of jacob karns?

00:30:10.220 --> 00:30:12.889
Sure as hell looked like
him. And that's not all.

00:30:13.228 --> 00:30:15.250
I don't think the spirit is
latching onto the reverend.

00:30:15.541 --> 00:30:17.665
Yeah,  the guy wouldn't send
the hookman after himself.

00:30:20.519 --> 00:30:22.044
I think it's latching onto lori.

00:30:22.790 --> 00:30:24.299
Last night she found out that her father

00:30:24.299 --> 00:30:26.152
Is having an affair
with a married woman.

00:30:26.309 --> 00:30:27.295
So what?

00:30:27.295 --> 00:30:28.362
So,  she's upset about it.

00:30:28.811 --> 00:30:30.633
She's upset about the immorality of it.

00:30:30.975 --> 00:30:32.410
She was raised to believe

00:30:32.410 --> 00:30:34.391
That if you do something
wrong, you get punished.

00:30:35.138 --> 00:30:36.847
Okay,  so she's conflicted,

00:30:37.158 --> 00:30:38.692
And the spirit of preacher karns

00:30:38.692 --> 00:30:40.250
Is latching onto her emotions

00:30:40.250 --> 00:30:41.739
And doing the punishing for her.

00:30:41.915 --> 00:30:42.781
Right.

00:30:43.122 --> 00:30:44.546
Rich comes on too strong.

00:30:44.716 --> 00:30:46.570
Taylor tries to make
her into a party girl.

00:30:47.142 --> 00:30:48.412
Dad has an affair.

00:30:49.124 --> 00:30:50.743
Remind me not to piss this girl off.

00:30:52.929 --> 00:30:54.977
But I burned those bones.I
buried them in salt.

00:30:55.230 --> 00:30:56.366
Why didn't that stop him?

00:30:57.683 --> 00:30:59.063
You must've missed something.

00:31:00.749 --> 00:31:02.714
No,  I burned everything in that coffin.

00:31:04.081 --> 00:31:05.313
Did you get the hook?

00:31:07.167 --> 00:31:07.969
The hook?

00:31:09.718 --> 00:31:10.741
It was the murder weapon,

00:31:10.919 --> 00:31:12.698
And in a way it was part of him.

00:31:15.607 --> 00:31:16.941
So,  like the bones,

00:31:16.941 --> 00:31:18.441
The hook is a source of his power.

00:31:19.428 --> 00:31:20.906
So,  if we find the hook...

00:31:21.176 --> 00:31:22.804
We stop the hookman.

00:31:30.925 --> 00:31:32.108
Here's something, I think.

00:31:33.627 --> 00:31:35.484
Log book, iowa state penitentiary.

00:31:35.484 --> 00:31:36.548
"Karns,
jacob --

00:31:36.548 --> 00:31:38.851
Personal affects, disposition there of."

00:31:38.851 --> 00:31:39.717
Does it mention the hook?

00:31:41.502 --> 00:31:44.011
"Upon execution,  all earthly
items shall be remanded

00:31:44.011 --> 00:31:45.249
"To the prisoner's houseof worship,

00:31:45.414 --> 00:31:46.674
St. Barnabas church."

00:31:48.127 --> 00:31:49.719
Isn't that where lori's father preaches?

00:31:49.719 --> 00:31:50.255
Yeah.

00:31:51.551 --> 00:31:52.686
Where lori lives?

00:31:53.266 --> 00:31:55.136
That's why the hookman'sbeen
haunting reverends

00:31:55.136 --> 00:31:57.292
And reverends' daughters
for the past 200 years.

00:31:57.292 --> 00:31:59.359
But if the hook were at
the church or lori's house,

00:31:59.359 --> 00:32:00.659
Don't you think someone
might've seen it?

00:32:01.037 --> 00:32:03.619
I mean,  a blood-Stained,
silver-Handled hook?

00:32:05.659 --> 00:32:06.802
Check the church records.

00:32:09.358 --> 00:32:11.848
"St. Barnabas donations, 1862.

00:32:11.848 --> 00:32:13.523
"Received
--Silver-Handled hook

00:32:13.678 --> 00:32:14.979
"From state penitentiary.

00:32:16.102 --> 00:32:16.871
Reforged."

00:32:18.376 --> 00:32:21.341
They melted it down, made
it into something else.

00:32:36.317 --> 00:32:37.716
All right.We can't take any chances.

00:32:37.716 --> 00:32:39.159
Anything silver goes in the fire.

00:32:39.515 --> 00:32:40.515
I agree.

00:32:41.591 --> 00:32:42.804
Lori's still at the hospital.

00:32:42.804 --> 00:32:43.823
We'll have to break in.

00:32:44.207 --> 00:32:45.293
All right, take your pick.

00:32:46.014 --> 00:32:46.898
I'll take the house.

00:32:47.380 --> 00:32:47.949
Okay.

00:32:50.648 --> 00:32:51.635
Hey.

00:32:53.251 --> 00:32:54.710
Stay out of her underwear drawer.

00:33:12.493 --> 00:33:14.256
I got everything that even looks silver.

00:33:14.256 --> 00:33:15.298
Better safe than sorry.

00:33:30.304 --> 00:33:31.129
Move,  move.

00:34:05.299 --> 00:34:06.166
Lori?

00:34:07.964 --> 00:34:09.237
What are you doing here?

00:34:09.237 --> 00:34:10.080
What is it?

00:34:11.299 --> 00:34:15.222
I've been trying to understand
what's been happening,  why.

00:34:15.570 --> 00:34:18.389
Now I know,  so I'm
praying for forgiveness.

00:34:19.303 --> 00:34:20.870
Forgiveness for what?

00:34:21.347 --> 00:34:22.548
Don't you see?

00:34:22.623 --> 00:34:24.337
I'm to blame for all this.

00:34:25.178 --> 00:34:28.283
I've read in the bible
about avenging angels.

00:34:28.361 --> 00:34:28.770
Trust me.

00:34:28.770 --> 00:34:32.058
This guy --
He's no angel.

00:34:32.994 --> 00:34:35.394
I was so angry at my father.

00:34:36.116 --> 00:34:38.065
Part of me wanted him punished,

00:34:39.302 --> 00:34:41.474
And then he came and he punished him.

00:34:41.688 --> 00:34:43.059
It's not your fault.

00:34:43.564 --> 00:34:44.798
Yes,  it is.

00:34:45.241 --> 00:34:46.805
I don't know how, but it is.

00:34:49.173 --> 00:34:50.217
I killed rich.

00:34:50.560 --> 00:34:51.574
Taylor,  too.

00:34:51.976 --> 00:34:53.572
I nearly killed my father.

00:34:54.007 --> 00:34:54.681
Lori.

00:34:56.782 --> 00:34:57.919
I can see it now.

00:34:58.974 --> 00:35:00.672
They didn't deserve to be punished.

00:35:01.043 --> 00:35:01.909
I do.

00:35:13.842 --> 00:35:15.570
Come on.We got to go.

00:35:24.893 --> 00:35:25.596
Go!

00:35:27.233 --> 00:35:27.964
Come on!

00:35:49.181 --> 00:35:49.968
No!

00:35:59.240 --> 00:36:00.958
Come on,  get up.

00:36:15.764 --> 00:36:16.814
Sam,  drop!

00:36:23.183 --> 00:36:24.493
I thought we got all the silver.

00:36:25.254 --> 00:36:26.360
Why is he still here?

00:36:26.395 --> 00:36:27.750
Maybe we missed something.

00:36:30.665 --> 00:36:32.387
Lori,  where did you getthat chain?

00:36:32.998 --> 00:36:34.178
My father gave it to me.

00:36:34.306 --> 00:36:35.194
Where'd your dad get it?

00:36:35.196 --> 00:36:37.088
It was a church
heirloom.He gave it to me.

00:36:37.823 --> 00:36:38.539
Is it silver?

00:36:38.539 --> 00:36:39.020
Yes.

00:36:56.451 --> 00:36:57.152
Sam.

00:38:07.880 --> 00:38:10.522
And you saw him,  too,
the man with the hook?

00:38:10.546 --> 00:38:12.306
Yes,  I told you.We all saw him.

00:38:12.306 --> 00:38:14.168
We fought him off, and then he ran.

00:38:14.721 --> 00:38:15.447
And that's all?

00:38:16.200 --> 00:38:17.011
Yeah,  that's all.

00:38:20.699 --> 00:38:22.842
Listen, you and
your brother --

00:38:22.842 --> 00:38:24.260
Oh,  don't worry.We're leaving town.

00:38:31.127 --> 00:38:32.203
You gonna be okay?

00:38:33.109 --> 00:38:34.056
Yeah.

00:38:44.216 --> 00:38:45.598
I still don't know what happened,

00:38:46.792 --> 00:38:49.640
But I do know you saved my life.

00:38:50.358 --> 00:38:51.520
My father's,  too.

00:38:51.993 --> 00:38:52.830
Thank you.

00:39:18.429 --> 00:39:19.455
